      <title>模型同质化时代，记忆才是AI真正的护城河</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260902/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%90%8C%E8%B4%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E6%89%8D%E6%98%AFAI%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%A4%E5%9F%8E%E6%B2%B3/</link>
